    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "サクラチヨノオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Chiyono O",
            "jpText": "えへへ、\r\n私たちの誕生祝い、どうでしたかヤエノさん？",
            "enText": "Ehehe, how did you like our \nbirthday celebration, Yaeno?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 5624789443729154855,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ヤエノムテキ",
            "enName": "Yaeno Muteki",
            "jpText": "くっ……！\r\n『ちいさなふれあい動物園』、\nあれは想像を絶する破壊力でしたっ……！",
            "enText": "<i>Ngh!</i> The Itty Bitty Critters Petting Zoo \npossessed destructive power beyond \nall imagining!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -8834663885256900431,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロアルダン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ardan",
            "jpText": "みなさん可愛らしかったですね。\r\nウサギも、リスも、モルモットも……。",
            "enText": "They were all so cute, weren't they? They had \nbunnies, and squirrels, and guinea pigs…",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 4252477183753307697,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ヤエノムテキ",
            "enName": "Yaeno Muteki",
            "jpText": "はい……！\r\n地上にあのような場所があったとは……。",
            "enText": "Yes! To think there was such a place \non this earth…",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -6050235344032887522,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ヤエノムテキ",
            "enName": "Yaeno Muteki",
            "jpText": "し、しかし、誕生日とはいえ、\r\n私が彼らを独占してもよかったのでしょうか？",
            "enText": "N-Now, I know it was my birthday, \nbut do you think it was okay for me \nto have them all to myself?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 7365774004831036549,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ヤエノムテキ",
            "enName": "Yaeno Muteki",
            "jpText": "チヨノオーさんやアルダンさんも、\r\n彼らを愛でたかったのでは……！？",
            "enText": "You two must have wanted to show \nthe critters some love too, didn't you?",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -6784314677206438837,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラチヨノオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Chiyono O",
            "jpText": "そこは大丈夫です。\r\nね、アルダンさん？",
            "enText": "We didn't mind. Right, Ardan?",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -8449916570155457023,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロアルダン",
            "enName": "Mejiro Ardan",
            "jpText": "はい。私たちは動物たちと楽しそうに過ごす\r\n可愛いヤエノさんが見られましたから。",
            "enText": "Right. Getting to see our adorable Yaeno \nenjoying her time with the critters was more \nthan enough.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -5383301729097133100,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ヤエノムテキ",
            "enName": "Yaeno Muteki",
            "jpText": "か、かかか可愛い……！？",
            "enText": "A-Adorable?!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 7190993343233174620,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ヤエノムテキ",
            "enName": "Yaeno Muteki",
            "jpText": "ご、ご冗談を！　無骨な私に\r\n可愛いなどという言葉は似合いませんっ！",
            "enText": "Y-You jest! I am far too uncouth \nto be deserving of that word!",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -2170166246360451698,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラチヨノオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Chiyono O",
            "jpText": "そんなことないと思いますよ？\r\nこうして照れているのもかわいいかなって。",
            "enText": "I don't think that's true at all. Even the way \nyou're getting all flustered now is cute too.",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": 1627037418771806266,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ヤエノムテキ",
            "enName": "Yaeno Muteki",
            "jpText": "ぐぁああああっ……！！",
            "enText": "Gahhh…!!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": -1973084712067573207,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
